// How the engines render the camera and sweep the lidar of the botshare base,
// each by the name it has in the description, whose frames place them.
//
// The camera is the Orbbec Gemini 336L at the base's front, measuring the
// depths the description's depth sensor gives it, the colour aligned to its
// depth.
//
// - fovy_deg: the depth field's 65 degrees high, of its 90 x 65
//   (openAMRobot/openamr-platform-sw at 69847ab7, the commit the description
//   is written from, ros2/src/openamrobot_description/config/sensor_profiles.yaml,
//   base_camera_link depth fov_vertical, from Orbbec's product page).
// - width, height and fps: a mode of this entry, 640 x 400 at 15 fps, half
//   each way of the depth's largest, 1280 x 800 at up to 30 fps (the same
//   file's width_max, height_max and frame_rate_max). botshare's software
//   sets no mode of the camera: the file says the rate on the robot is set in
//   the driver launch, and the repository holds none for it.
//
// The lidar is the RPLIDAR S3, measuring the ranges the description's
// gpu_lidar sensor gives it, swept as the scan of the sllidar_ros2 driver
// that botshare runs it under: scan_mode DenseBoost, angle_compensate true
// and the scan frequency at its default, 10 Hz (openAMRobot/openamr-platform-sw
// at 69847ab7, ros2/src/openamrobot_drivers/launch/drivers.launch.py).
//
// - rays: sllidar_node (Slamtec/sllidar_ros2 at 34300099, src/sllidar_node.cpp)
//   compensates a turn of points_per_circle, 3200 at the S3's 32 kHz sample
//   rate and 10 Hz (sensor_profiles.yaml, lidar_link scan sample_rate and
//   scan_rate), into 360 x angle_compensate_multiple rays, the multiple the
//   integer part of 3200 / 360 + 1, 9: 3240.
// - min_angle_rad and angle_increment_rad: the driver gives its scan from pi
//   less a whole turn, -pi, at the turn over its rays less one, 2 pi / 3239,
//   so its last ray points where its first does.
// - scan_rate_hz: the scan frequency, 10.
{
  cameras: {
    base_camera: {
      fovy_deg: 65.0,
      color: { width: 640, height: 400 },
      depth: { width: 640, height: 400 },
      fps: 15,
    },
  },
  lidars: {
    lidar: {
      min_angle_rad: -3.141592653589793,
      angle_increment_rad: 0.001939853444637106,
      rays: 3240,
      scan_rate_hz: 10,
    },
  },
}
